          "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_retrieval_based_language_models_impr",
          "text": "Retrieval-based language models improve on standard neural models by fetching nearest-neighbor examples from an external datastore and blending them into the prediction.",
