          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_building_completely_unsupervised_req",
          "text": "Building it is completely unsupervised, requires no extra training data, and works whether the automaton is constructed from the model's own training corpus or from a brand-new domain.",
